  "post_content": "<p>(70 fotos) La primera edici&oacute; del festival de m&uacute;sica en valenci&agrave; Karraska-Rock d&rsquo;A&iacute;n, organitzat per Cultura&iacute;n i patrocinat per l&rsquo;Ajuntament i la Diputaci&oacute; Provincial de Castell&oacute;, es va celebrar amb gran &egrave;xit la nit i la matinada de dissabte a diumenge.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/07/IMG_8882.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>L&rsquo;actuaci&oacute; infantil abans de sopar de</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/07/TrobadoretsAin1.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 270px;\" /></p>\n<p>Trobadorets va deixar pas despr&eacute;s a</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/07/IMG_8830.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>Malesmans,</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/07/IMG_8841.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>Assekes,</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/07/IMG_8890.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>Egalit&eacute; i</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/07/IMG_8916.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>Hereus, per aquest ordre.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/07/IMG_8905.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 720px;\" /></p>\n<p>L&rsquo;alcalde d&rsquo;A&iacute;n, Javier Sorribes Gil (a l&#39;esquerra de la foto, va dir en acabar que &ldquo;ja s&rsquo;est&agrave; preparant el festival Karraska-Rock de 2017&rdquo;.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/karraskarockain16/img_8830.jpg\" alt=\"img_8830\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:au